000100*-----------------------------------------------------------------
000200* Sample COBOL program for checking syntax highlighting
000300*-----------------------------------------------------------------
000400 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000500 PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.
000600
000700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000900 REPOSITORY.
001000     FUNCTION ALL INTRINSIC.
001100
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001400 01  WS-NAME             PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
001500 01  WS-AMOUNT           PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
001600 01  WS-EDITED           PIC IS ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
001700 01  WS-CRLF             PIC XX VALUE X"0D0A".
001800 01  WS-FLAG             PIC X.
001900     88  WS-DONE                     VALUE "Y".
002000
002100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002200 0000-MAIN SECTION.
002300 MAIN-PARA.
002400     MOVE "IT""S A TEST" TO WS-NAME
