002700     DISPLAY FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-NAME) *> floating comment
002800     IF WS-AMOUNT > 100
002900        DISPLAY 'BIG AMOUNT: ' WS-EDITED
003000     ELSE
003100        PERFORM 1000-SMALL THRU 1000-EXIT
003200     END-IF
003300D    DISPLAY "DEBUGGING LINE"
003400     DISPLAY "THIS LITERAL IS CONTINUED ON THE NEXT LINE AND STILL
003500-    "GOES ON HERE"
